  "prefLabel": "Agr 705.08 Gift of Easement or Other Deed Restrictions",
  "priorExpiration": "1992-07-22",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Agr 705.08 Gift of Easement or Other Deed Restrictions. Applicants offering to make gifts of preservation or conservation easements or other deed restrictions to additional land shall receive up to 10 additional points according to the following schedule:\n\n(a) Gifts of up to 20 percent of value of agricultural land development rights proposed to be sold shall qualify the application for 5 points; and\n\n(b) Each additional 10 percent shall qualify the application for one point.\n\nSource. #4098, eff 7-22-86, EXPIRED: 7-22-92\n\nNew. #7463, eff 3-21-01\n\nNew. #13910, eff 3-21-24 (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Agr 700)",
